# GitHub language bar. Linguist has no "Komodo" language yet, so it ignores
# .km/.kmm and would otherwise label the repo by its support code (shell CLI,
# C runtime, awk/python tools, editor plugins). Keep that out of the stats;
# .km/.kmm count automatically once Komodo is added to Linguist
# (.linguist-language.yml is the entry to submit upstream).
* linguist-detectable=false
*.km linguist-language=Komodo linguist-detectable=true
*.kmm linguist-language=Komodo linguist-detectable=true
